# The appliance's geometry, docs and pictures — one action per generator. Written by
# tools/bazel/gen_build.py off tools/bazel/inventory.py; the sandbox corrects it.
#
# WHAT AN ACTION HOLDS IS WHAT IT NAMED. A generator reads the Python its imports
# reach, the solids it loads and the docs it rewrites; all three are `srcs`, and
# nothing else is in the directory the run happens in. A solid one generator cuts and
# the next loads is an edge like any other: unnamed, the reader does not find the file.

